        <title>ColorPickr</title>
        <item>
            <title>0.15.3</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:37:46 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/dhuet/colorbody-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Fixed: after you turned on Screen Recording, ColorPickr could keep asking for it. It now checks with macOS&#x27;s screen capture directly instead of trusting a status that can lag behind System Settings.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/dhuet/colorbody-releases/releases/download/v0.15.3/ColorPickr-0.15.3.dmg" length="6187863" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="B1xJzG8/UxXvDu7d1RWB6dOCRZVkanCU2EBiz2uFM5doOoKqsqWkX10/N9q6yeBLT/SzXsWYuadNU0DeJFlZAA=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.15.2</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 18:25:46 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/dhuet/colorbody-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>8</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>The color vision simulation is easier to leave: the pill under the menu bar now has a <b>Turn off</b> button, so you don&#x27;t need to remember ⌃⌥V.</li><li>Fixed: when Screen Recording access was missing, the alert asking for it could come straight back after you clicked Later.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/dhuet/colorbody-releases/releases/download/v0.15.2/ColorPickr-0.15.2.dmg" length="6184860" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="q8pm3nHIkfCPBdUWMs3Ecjh7HBd+JA7jfNN5KDwvdImElu5N7cePq+PqH+UFOk66iXw0mw0WCr+0iNq7LR7mCg=="/>
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>0.15.1</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:10:09 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/dhuet/colorbody-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>7</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Contrast fixes are smaller: ColorPickr now stops at the closest color that passes instead of a few shades past it, so your brand color changes as little as possible.</li><li>New <b>Jetpack Compose</b> format, `Color(0xFFE9EEF7)`. Smart Formats uses it when you pick while working in Android Studio.</li><li>Keyboard shortcuts in the menu bar panel: <b>⌘C</b> copies your default format, <b>⌘1</b> to <b>⌘4</b> copy the format tiles.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/dhuet/colorbody-releases/releases/download/v0.15.1/ColorPickr-0.15.1.dmg" length="6174271" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="wOunzCM/uIA5DvNjSzjhyapqJ1DACIbbqAomTuw/WuWuxvbusvcs5zNqdUEkCtji778mk6fB1rTLAdmnNE08AQ=="/>
        </item>
